{"4600680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eternal Hatred", "steam_appid": 4600680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4822360], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Hatred I feel</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Is trying to fill.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's trying to kill</i><br><i>...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break the vicious cycle or become a part of it.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternal Hatred</strong> is an uncompromising, high-octane boomer shooter that blends the aesthetics of <strong>ULTRAKILL, Doom, and Quake</strong> with a deep psychological story about the nature of human cruelty. This is a journey into the abyss of consciousness, where every shot is an attempt to drown out inner pain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story and Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a surreal world crafted from fears and suppressed memories. Here, enemies are &quot;cells of hatred,&quot; embodying pure aggression and old traumas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, the Antagonist — the embodiment of Violence itself — will speak to you. Are you fighting evil, or are you fueling it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark tale of how one person's hatred breeds violence in another. It is hard to live while hiding your feelings, but is it worth letting them loose?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system demands not just precision, but absolute control from you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin the revolver</strong> on your finger, use ricochets, and detonate your own projectiles in mid-air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry</strong> enemy attacks, but remember — sometimes your opponents are capable of counter-parrying, and sometimes their attacks cannot be parried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane speed</strong>: Use slides, dashes, and the Multiplier system, which accelerates you to the limit and increases your jump height as long as you keep killing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> 5 acts featuring an original soundtrack, full voice acting, and a unique visual design where clever puzzles transition into fierce battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation Mode:</strong> Test your skills in a single small arena with ever-increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Violence cannot be defeated by violence. But perhaps, the attempt is worth it?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Hatred I feel</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Is trying to fill.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's trying to kill</i><br><i>...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break the vicious cycle or become a part of it.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternal Hatred</strong> is an uncompromising, high-octane boomer shooter that blends the aesthetics of <strong>ULTRAKILL, Doom, and Quake</strong> with a deep psychological story about the nature of human cruelty. This is a journey into the abyss of consciousness, where every shot is an attempt to drown out inner pain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story and Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a surreal world crafted from fears and suppressed memories. Here, enemies are &quot;cells of hatred,&quot; embodying pure aggression and old traumas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, the Antagonist — the embodiment of Violence itself — will speak to you. Are you fighting evil, or are you fueling it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark tale of how one person's hatred breeds violence in another. It is hard to live while hiding your feelings, but is it worth letting them loose?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system demands not just precision, but absolute control from you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin the revolver</strong> on your finger, use ricochets, and detonate your own projectiles in mid-air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry</strong> enemy attacks, but remember — sometimes your opponents are capable of counter-parrying, and sometimes their attacks cannot be parried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane speed</strong>: Use slides, dashes, and the Multiplier system, which accelerates you to the limit and increases your jump height as long as you keep killing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> 5 acts featuring an original soundtrack, full voice acting, and a unique visual design where clever puzzles transition into fierce battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation Mode:</strong> Test your skills in a single small arena with ever-increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Violence cannot be defeated by violence. But perhaps, the attempt is worth it?</i></p>", "short_description": "Eternal Hatred is a fast-paced indie shooter blending the aesthetics of ULTRAKILL and Quake. At its core lies a dark story about the nature of human cruelty and an attempt to drown out inner pain within the abyss of one's own consciousness.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4600680/89e12c143134b93a6225097cd31bc2c7333880da/header.jpg?t=1788165519", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4600680/55d4d358f631a62ec962145b08771871e977c845/capsule